## í´§ Configuring Alertmanager Notifications

### Slack Integration

Edit the Prometheus values file:

```yaml
alertmanager:
  config:
    receivers:
    - name: 'slack'
      slack_configs:
      - api_url: 'https://hooks.slack.com/services/YOUR/SLACK/WEBHOOK'
        channel: '#alerts'
        title: 'BookStore Alert'
        text: '{{ range .Alerts }}{{ .Annotations.description }}{{ end }}'
```

### Email Notifications

```yaml
alertmanager:
  config:
    receivers:
    - name: 'email'
      email_configs:
      - to: 'team@example.com'
        from: 'alertmanager@example.com'
        smarthost: 'smtp.gmail.com:587'
        auth_username: 'your-email@gmail.com'
        auth_password: 'your-app-password'
```

### PagerDuty Integration

```yaml
alertmanager:
  config:
    receivers:
    - name: 'pagerduty'
      pagerduty_configs:
      - service_key: 'YOUR_PAGERDUTY_SERVICE_KEY'
```

### Apply Configuration

```bash
helm upgrade kube-prometheus-stack prometheus-community/kube-prometheus-stack \
  --namespace monitoring \
  --values updated-prometheus-values.yaml
```

## í¾¯ Best Practices

### 1. Set Appropriate Retention
```yaml
prometheus:
  prometheusSpec:
    retention: 15d
    retentionSize: "9GB"
```

### 2. Configure Resource Limits
```yaml
prometheus:
  prometheusSpec:
    resources:
      requests:
        cpu: 500m
        memory: 2Gi
      limits:
        cpu: 1000m
        memory: 4Gi
```

### 3. Enable Persistent Storage
```yaml
prometheus:
  prometheusSpec:
    storageSpec:
      volumeClaimTemplate:
        spec:
          accessModes: ["ReadWriteOnce"]
          resources:
            requests:
              storage: 10Gi
```

### 4. Use Service Monitors
- Automatically discover targets
- Label-based selection
- Configurable scrape intervals

### 5. Create Meaningful Alerts
- Set appropriate thresholds
- Include actionable descriptions
- Use severity levels (critical, warning, info)
- Group related alerts

### 6. Organize Dashboards
- Use folders for categorization
- Apply consistent naming conventions
- Add descriptions and links
- Tag dashboards appropriately

